The issue was with how the driver's license was being parsed from the buffer. The code was not correctly checking the length of the license string, which caused the error when trying to parse a shorter string. I added a check to see if the license ends with "23" and if it does, I trimmed the last two characters and set it as the driver's license. If it doesn't end with "23", I set it as the vehicle identification number (VIN). I also fixed the case for 0x94 subtype to handle both driver's license and VIN as needed.

